### 1. Test Health / Server Check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### 2. Register New User (OTP will be returned in response & printed in terminal)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jamesdev",
  "email": "james@example.com",
  "password": "Password123456"
}

### 3. Verify OTP Code (Paste the 6-digit OTP from register response/console)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "james@example.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 4. Resend Verification OTP
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "james@example.com"
}

### 5. Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "james@example.com",
  "password": "Password123456"
}

### 6. Access Protected Dashboard (Uses httpOnly cookie from login)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard

### 7. Logout (Revokes token JTI in database & clears cookie)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout

### 8. Verify Blacklist Protection (Should return 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dashboard

### 9. Create Product (Admin Only - Requires admin login cookie)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "0114-GPU",
  "name": "Ridgeline RX-7800",
  "category": "Graphics Cards",
  "swatch": "RTX-CLASS · 16GB",
  "price": 649.00,
  "stock_quantity": 45,
  "description": "High-performance graphics card bench-tested for 1440p and 4K ultra gaming.",
  "specs": {
    "Boost Clock": "2,650 MHz",
    "VRAM": "16GB GDDR6",
    "TDP": "263W"
  },
  "bench_stats": {
    "Cyberpunk 4K": "78 FPS",
    "Max Temp": "64°C",
    "Noise": "26 dBA"
  },
  "image_url": "/uploads/products/default-gpu.png",
  "is_active": true
}

### 10. Get All Products (Public - With optional query filters)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?category=Graphics%20Cards&page=1&limit=10

### 11. Get Product by SKU (Public)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/sku/0114-GPU

### 12. Get Product by ID (Public)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/1

### 13. Update Product (Admin Only)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 599.00,
  "stock_quantity": 50
}

### 14. Delete Product (Admin Only)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/1